{"overview":"در یک شب سرد، آریچی، که از جامعه بیرون‌زده است، توسط زامبی گاز می‌شود و پس از کوتاه‌مدت تفکر در مورد پایان دادن به زندگی‌اش، تصمیم می‌گیرد بفهمد بدن‌اش چه اتفاقی می‌افتد. با کمک تنها دوستی‌اش و علاقه‌مندی طولانی‌مدت‌اش، آریچی به دنبال درمان می‌رود تا قبل از اینکه تبدیل به هیولای کامل شود و همه را بکشد، او را پیدا کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"One cold night, misfit Archie gets bitten by a zombie and after briefly considering ending his life, he decides he's going to figure out what the hell is happening to his body. So, with the help of his only friend and his lifelong crush, Archie sets out to find a cure before he turns into a full-blown monster and kills everyone.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":8,"y":2026,"poster":"/hVS28DHtdssBr7FO4AKOEW2Aqpc.jpg"}],"episodes":8,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["MX","US"],"cast":[{"name":"Fernanda Castillo","role":"Sarah Díaz","photo":"/RMfrmN0HSVxaqYqesbcmvutTAg.jpg"},{"name":"Luis Fernando Peña","role":"Sargento Peña","photo":"/1nooPX0s6Qi03Npt1Wr9AK7gE08.jpg"},{"name":"Armando Hernández","role":"Gerardo","photo":"/5J0sQ0P2IBy1fTPDD3f8I2tJIZF.jpg"},{"name":"Tiaré Scanda","role":"Wendy","photo":"/tEIJnn5ZVHUtDdFLhHP0Q2Fdgxx.jpg"},{"name":"Farah Justiniani","role":"Brenda Argüelles","photo":"/lKVOx4MzjuRroREZowdPIUgw0kr.jpg"},{"name":"Azalia Ortiz","role":"Directora Ruth","photo":"/pU4jjmRQlp4Yi0MaXJPGUtG7LTu.jpg"},{"name":"Lilith Curiel","role":"Cristina Lemus","photo":"/poimeshzntuRSiggrBV7w9sXVRD.jpg"},{"name":"Valentina Garcia","role":"Wendy","photo":"/7ZOogsZoj6JHxnUpAaB5AcYbAxz.jpg"},{"name":"Alfonso Borbolla","role":"Profesor Alba","photo":"/60Pw7d3SNCIAf5Iw6QAaikIl9p.jpg"},{"name":"Diego Bernal","role":"Archibaldo Pérez","photo":""},{"name":"Leonardo Ávila","role":"Domingo","photo":""},{"name":"Lissa","role":"Martha","photo":""}],"trailer":"ojteM2SYB88","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/335227-prefiero-la-muerte/watc